900
00:40:55,750 --> 00:40:58,210
across the mesh dimensions.

901
00:40:58,210 --> 00:41:01,120
And so just that
simple abstraction

902
00:41:01,120 --> 00:41:03,010
supports sort of
data parallelism

903
00:41:03,010 --> 00:41:07,030
or some other parallelism and
